    "chunk_size_bytes": 1842,
    "chunk_text": "This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - G 31371 \u2014 67 (10/2019)\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'29PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 29.10.20192A\n\n(c)the said Trustees shall, by the said name and style, be able and competent in law to sue and be sued, toanswer and to be answered, to defend and be defended, in any court in Sri Lanka or elsewhere in all casesand actions arising in relation to the said Trust.\n\nThis Order may be revoked, or from time to time be varied or amended in such manner as appear to me to benecessary.\n\nTHALATHA ATHUKORALA,Minister of Justice and Prison Reforms.Colombo,22nd October, 2019.\n\n11- 1015/1\n\nL.D.B. 104/44(v)\n\nTRUSTS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 87)\n\nOrder under Section 114\n\nI, Thalatha Athukorala, Minister of Justice and Prison Reforms, do by this Order, revoke the Order made under Section114 of the Trusts Ordinance (Chapter 87) and published in the Ceylon Government Gazette, No. 12,099 of April 1, 1960,incorporating \u201cthe Trustees of the Society of Jesus in the Mission of Galle\u201d.\n\nTHALATHA ATHUKORALA,Minister of Justice and Prison Reforms.\n\nColombo,22nd October, 2019.\n\n11- 1015/2\n\nL.D.B. 104/44(v)\n\nTRUSTS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 87)\n\nOrder under Section 114\n\nI, Thalatha Athukorala, Minister of Justice and Prison Reforms, do by this Order, revoke the Order made under Section114 of the Trusts Ordinance (Chapter 87) and published in the Ceylon Government Gazette, No. 12,077 of March 11,1960, incorporating \u201cthe Superior Regular of the Society of Jesus in the Diocese of Trincomalee\u201d.\n\nTHALATHA ATHUKORALA,Minister of Justice and Prison Reforms.Colombo,22nd October, 2019.\n\n11- 1015/3\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
