    "chunk_text": "25th October, 2019, At Ukuwella Divisional Secretariat, Ukuwela.\n\n11-1035\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 31373 - 27 (2019/10)\n\nAmendment THE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) Notice under Section 7 Reference the Gazette No. 14644 dated 21.01.1966. Description of the land to be acquired: Preliminary Plan No. Co 93, Village - Ahugammana, Divisional Secretariat - Mahara District - Gampaha. Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: Millagahawatta; Extent: 00 acres, 00 roods, 23.7 perches Lot No. 02 Name of the Land: Madalanda; Extent: 02 acres, 00 roods, 01.5 perches The time given for all persons those who are interested in the aforesaid land by that Gazette notification is amended as follows;\n\nAccordingly all persons interested in the aforesaid land are here by required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Mahara Divisional Secretariat on the 20th November 2019 at 10.00 a.m. Further you are hereby requested to notify me in writing in duplicate on or before the 13th November 2019, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation, for the acquisition of the said land the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount in duplicate. The deed and other documents in proof of the title should be submitted at the inquairy. . G. S. I. WIMALASENA, Divisional Secretary, Land Acquiring Officer Mahara.\n\n29th October, 2019, Mahara Divisional Secretariat, Ranmuthugala, Kadawatha.\n\n11-1036\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
