    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'30PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 30.10.20191A\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2147$57 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 30 jeks nodod - 2019'10'30No. 2147/57 - WEDNESDAY, OCTOBER 30, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n1A G 31378 - 50 (10/2019)\n\nERRATA\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me, under Section 92 of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board Act, No.02 of1974, I, Rauff Hakeem, Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, declared that Schedule on page2A and 3A published in the Extraordinary Gazette No. under No. 2063/37 dated 22.03.2018 of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka, though it is mentioned as name of the land is Badulukele it should be named as Udahena, though itis metioned as extent was 0.0668Ha. (26.41p.) it should be 0.0763 Ha. (30.17p.), though the claimant name and addresswas Mr. B. Kahadagamage, Medawaththahena, Kithalagama Central, Thihagoda it should be mentioned as Mr. LiyanaMudiyanselage Thilakasiri, No. 3, Henapawula Gedara, Kithalagama East, Thihagoda and the boundaries depicted in theAdvancing Tracing No. MR/THG/2017/462 prepared by the Department of Surveyor should be amended as follows ;\n\nNorth by :Lot No. A, Medawaththa Hena claimed by Bastian Kahadagamage and land claimed byKamal Ramanayake ;East by:Land claimed by Kamal Ramanayake and Udahena claimed by Liyana Mudiyanselage Thilakasiri ;South by :Udahena claimed by Liyana Mudiyanselage Thilakasiri and road ;West by:Road and Lot No. A."
