    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'10'31PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 31.10.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nORDER UNDER SECTION 39 A (1)\n\nTHE allotments specified in the Order No. 199 of 2015 made underthe Proviso (a) to Section 38 of the Land Acquisition Act(Chapter 460) and published in the Gazette Extra OrdinaryNo. 1944/6 dated 07.12.2015 is vested absolutely in the State andthe possession of which has been taken for or on behalf of the Stateunder Para (a) of Section 40 of the aforesaid Act. But by the virtue ofpowers vested in me by Sub-section (1) of Section 39(a) (inserted byAct, No. 8 of 1979) of the Land Acquisition Act. I, GayanthaKarunatilleke, Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,do hereby divest only the allotment described in the Schedule 1below.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy No.: 4-3/10/2012/LRB/186.Acquiring Officer No.: WGSWD&EIP/ACQ/DW/05.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Avenue,Battaramulla.29th October, 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nThe Allotments of land depicted in below names and extents in theTracing No. CO/DHL/2019/300 dated 03.09.2019 prepared by theSurveyor-General, situated in the Village called Kohuwala in theGrama Niladhari Division No. 537-B of Kohuwala in the DivisionalSecretary\u2019s Divisions of Dehiwala in Colombo District of WesternProvince and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Dikdeniya Kumbura, Millagaha Owita andKotuwe Kumbura \u2013 Extent: About 0.0106 HectareNorth: Lot Nos. 7, 5 of Tracing No. CO/DSO/2015/551 andNugegoda Canal; East: Nugegoda Canal and Lot No. 6 of TracingNo. CO/DSO/2015/551; South: Lot Nos. 6 and 8 of Tracing No. CO/DSO/2015/551; West: Lot Nos. 8 and 7 of Tracing No. CO/DSO/2015/551."
