    "chunk_text": "wxl 2147$70 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 31 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'10'31No. 2147/70 \u2013 THURSDAY, OCTOBER 31, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lkG 31392 - 32 (10/2019)\n\nLAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 7\n\nMy No.: KOT/LND/ACQVI/01/39.\n\nLand Min. Ref. No.: 4-3/8/2017/PC/556.\n\nI hereby notify under Sub-section 7 of the Land AcquisitionAct, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendments) ActNo. 28 of 1964, that the government intends to acquire thefollowing land which is required for public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired:\n\nAllotments of the land called Handferd Estate situated atMathugobe (Now Deniyaya) Village of Kalugalahena GramaNiladhari's Divisions of Kotapola Divisional Secretariat ofMatara District in the Southern Province, depicted as LotNos. 1509, 1510, 1511, 1512, 1513, 1514 and lot No. 1515 ofsupplementary sheet No. 134 of sheet No. 116 in F.V.P. 169prepared by Survey General, containing in extent about13.4138 Hectares and boundaries of the land given below.\n\n1. Lot No. 1509 \u2013 Name of the Land: Handferd Estate;Person who claimant: Talawakele Plantation Company Ltd,Deens Road, No. 400, Colombo 10; Containing in Extentabout: 12.0162 Hectares.\n\nNorth by: Lot No. 87; East by: Lot No. 87; South by: LotNo. 87 and 1510; West by: Lot No. 1510 and 87.\n\n2. Lot No. 1510 \u2013 Name of the Land: Handferd Estate;Person who claimant: Talawakele Plantation Company Ltd,Deens Road, No. 400, Colombo 10; Containing in Extentabout: 0.2970 Hectare.\n\nNorth by: Lot No. 1509; East by: Lot No. 1509 and Road(Road Development Authority; South by: Road (RoadDevelopment Authority) Lot Nos. 1515, 1514, 1513, 1512, 87and 1511; West by: Lot No. 87 and 1511."
