    "chunk_text": "wxl 2148$8 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 04 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'11'04No. 2148/8 \u2013 MONDAY, NOVEMBER 04, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lkG 31409 - 25 (11/2019)\n\nLAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) ASAMENDED BY THE LAND ACQUISITION(AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 28 OF 1964\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy No.: KEG/LAN/AQUIS/A3/1/84.\n\nLand Ministry's Ref. No.: 4-3/15/2016/HW/580.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act as Amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment Act), No. 28 of 1964 that theGovernment intends to acquire the land called RadagolahelaKumbura described in the Schedule given below forconstruction of a retaining wall in the boundary place of0+420 km of Kegalle By Pass (Phase 11) of KegalleDivisional Secretariat Division.\n\nDescription of the Land to be acquired:\n\nTwo (02) allotments of land attached below depicted inPreliminary Plan No. 3567 prepared by the SurveyorGeneral, Kegalle situated in the Golahela village (WithinKegalle Town limits) of 15E, Golahela Grama NiladhariDivision in Kegalle Divisional Secretary's Division ofKegalle District in Sabaragamuwa Province.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nPlan No. P.P. K. 3567\n\nLot No. 01Name of the Land: Radagolahela Kumbura; Descriptionof the Boundaries: Name and Address of claimant: Firstclaimants are Gamaralalage Nimal Jayantha Abeywardana ofNo. 171, Main Street, Kegalle, Disanayake HalawathMudiyanselage Anuruddhika Manori Wijesinghe of No. B92,Gepala, Ekiriyagala, Kegalle and H.M.P.T. Tishan Wijesingheof No. 292, Bandaranayaka Mawatha, Hospital Junction,Kegalle; Extent: 0.0248 Hectare.\n\nIII fldgi - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'