    "chunk_text": "\u201cUser Fee National Highways\u201d includes Barawakumbuka \u2013 Mattala User Fee National Highway (Section of Extension of Southern Expressway) from Barawakumbuka (178.656 km) to Mattala (200.451 km) and Andarawewa \u2013 Hambantota User Fee National Highway from Andarawewa (0.000km) to Hambantota (16.558km).\n\n(b) a second or subsequent offence; to a \ufb01 ne not exceeding \ufb01 fty thousand rupees.\n\n3AI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'08PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 08.11.2019\n\nU S E R F E E R AT E S ( R s . ) F O R A L L C AT E G O R I E SDistance11.3km 10.4km 18.4km Distances between interchanges\n\nBarawakumbuka\n\nSooriyawewa\n\nMattala Gate\n\nHambantota Gate\n\nSooriyawewa100\n\nMattala Gate200100\n\nHambantota Gate200100100\n\nFor the operation of Barawakumbuka \u2013 Mattala User Fee National Highway (Section of Extension of Southern Expressway) and Andarawewa \u2013 Hambantota User Fee National Highway, a single toll rate system for all categories of vehicles shall be used.\n\nOnce the entire Southern Expressway Extension from Godagama to Mattala is connected to Southern Expressway this single toll rate shall be adjusted to integrate with current user fee rates of Southern Expressway.\n\npurpose\n\n4AI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'08PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 08.11.2019\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nPart B\n\nVEHICLES EXEMPT FROM PAYMENT OF USER FEE ONBARAWAKUMBUKA \u2013 MATTALA USER FEE NATIONAL HIGHWAY (SECTION OF EXTENSION OF SOUTHERN EXPRESSWAY) AND ANDARAWEWA \u2013 HAMBANTOTA USER FEE NATIONAL HIGHWAY 1. All vehicles which form part of the Presidential Convoy at any given time for so long as such vehicle is driven along the User Fee National Highway.\n\n2. All vehicles which form part of the Prime Ministerial Convoy at any given time for so long as such vehicle is driven along the User Fee National Highway."
