    "chunk_text": "1AI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'08PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 08.11.2019\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2148$50 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 08 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'11'08No. 2148/50 - FRIDAY, NOVEMBER 08, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERALGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A- G 31432 - 19 (11/2019)\n\nTHE NOTICE TO RECTIFY THE EXTRAORDINARY GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALISTREPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA BEARING NO. 2129/95 DATED 28TH JUNE, 2019\n\nI, Patali Champika Ranawaka, Minister of Megapolis and Western Development, by virtue of the powers vested in me underthe Urban Development Authority Law, No. 41 of 1978 as amended, do hereby rectify the Extraordinary Gazette Notificationbearing No. 2129/95 dated 28th June, 2019 (07-4554/6).\n\nThe caption of the upper part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification \u201cAND MAGALLE PRADESHIYA SABHA\u201dShall be deleted.\n\nThe word \u201cAND\u201d shall be inserted immediately after \u201cBOPE PODDALA PRADESHIYA SABHA (PART)\u201d.\n\nThe content of the upper part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be rectified by repealing \u201cMagallePradeshiya Sabha\u201d as being part of the Greater Galle Urban Development Area.\n\nThe word \u201chad\u201d in the fourth line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substituted with \u201chave.\u201d\n\nThe rectifications introduced to the upper part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be read as follows;\n\n\u201cNOTICE OF APPROVAL OF THE DEVELOPMENT PLAN FOR THE GREATER GALLE URBAN DEVELOPMENT AREACOMPRISING OF GALLE MUNICIPAL COUNCIL, AKMEEMANA PRADESHIYA SABHA (PART), BOPE PODDALAPRADESHIYA SABHA (PART) AND HABARADUWA PRADESHIYA SABHA (PART) AREAS.\u201d"
