    "chunk_size_bytes": 2052,
    "chunk_text": "\u201cNOTICE OF APPROVAL OF THE DEVELOPMENT PLAN FOR THE GREATER GALLE URBAN DEVELOPMENT AREACOMPRISING OF GALLE MUNICIPAL COUNCIL, AKMEEMANA PRADESHIYA SABHA (PART), BOPE PODDALAPRADESHIYA SABHA (PART) AND HABARADUWA PRADESHIYA SABHA (PART) AREAS.\u201d\n\n\u201cNOTICE is hereby given to the General Public of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka under Section 8G of theUrban Development Authority Law, No. 41 of 1978 as amended from time to time that I, Patali Champika Ranawaka, theMinister in charge of the subject of Megapolis and Western Development, by virtue of the powers vested in me underSection 8F of the said Law, have approved the Development Plan on the 28th day of June, 2019 for the Greater GalleUrban Development Area comprising of the Galle Municipal Council, Akmeemana Pradeshiya Sabha (Part), BopePoddala Pradeshiya Sabha (Part) and Habaraduwa Pradeshiya Sabha (Part) areas, prepared under Section 8A of thesaid Law.\u201d\n\nPATALI CHAMPIKA RANAWAKA,Minister of Megapolis and Western Development.\n\n07th November, 2019.\n\nThe caption of the latter part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification \u201cMagalle Pradeshiya Sabha\u201d shall be deleted.\n\nThe word \u201cand\u201d shall be inserted immediately after \u201cBope Poddala Pradeshiya Sabha (Part)\u201d.\n\nIn the content of the latter part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification the word \u201c(Amendment)\u201d in the second lineshall be substituted with \u201cLaw, No. 41 of 1978 as amended by the\u201d.\n\nThe content of the latter part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be rectified by repealing \u201cMagallePradeshiya Sabha\u201d as being part of the Greater Galle Urban Development Area.\n\nThe word \u201chave\u201din the fourth line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substituted with \u201chas\u201d.\n\nThe word \u201cAmendment Act\u201d given in the last line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substituted with\u201camended Law\u201d.\n\nThe rectifications introduced to the latter part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be read as follows;."
  },
