    "chunk_text": "1AI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'08PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 08.11.2019\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2148$51 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 08 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'11'08No. 2148/51 - FRIDAY, NOVEMBER 08, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERALGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A- G 31433 - 19 (11/2019)\n\nTHE NOTICE TO RECTIFY THE EXTRAORDINARY GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALISTREPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA BEARING No. 2129/95 DATED 28TH JUNE, 2019\n\nI, Patali Champika Ranawaka, Minister of Megapolis and Western Development, by virtue of the powers vested in me underthe Urban Development Authority Law, No. 41 of 1978 as amended, do hereby rectify the Extraordinary Gazette Notificationbearing No. 2129/95 dated 28th June, 2019 (07-4554/10).\n\nIn the caption of the upper part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification the words \u201cMUNICIPAL COUNCIL AREA\u201dShall be substituted with \u201cURBAN DEVELOPMENT AREA COMPRISING OF THE POLONNARUWA MUNICIPALCOUNCIL AND POLONNARUWA PRADESHIYA SABHA (PART) AREAS.\u201d\n\nThe content of the upper part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be rectified by establishing therelevance of the said Development Paln to, POLONNARUWA URBAN DEVELOPMENT AREA COMPRISING OF THEPOLONNARUWA MUNICIPAL COUNCIL AND POLONNARUWA PRADESHIYA SABHA (PART) AREAS.\n\nThe word \u201chad\u201d in the fourth line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substituted with \u201chave\u201d.\n\nThe rectifications introduced to the upper part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be read as follows;"
