    "chunk_text": "The word \u201cAmendment\u201d in the second line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substituted with\u201cLow, No. 41 of 1978 as amended by the\u201d.\n\nThe words \u201cAmendment Act\u201d given in the last line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substituted with\u201camended Law.\u201d\n\n\u201cApproval of the Development Plan for the Polonnaruwa Urban Development Area comprising of the PolonnaruwaMinicipal Council and Polonnaruwa Pradeshiya Sabha (Part) Areas.\u201d\n\nPublic are hereby informed that the Development Plan prepared under Section 8A of the Urban Development AuthorityLaw, No. 41 of 1978 as amended by the Act, No. 4 of 1982, for the Polonnaruwa Urban Development Area comprising ofthe Polonnaruwa Municipal Council and Polonnaruwan Pradeshiya Sabha (Part) areas, has been approved on 28thJune, 2019 by Hon. Patali Champika Ranawaka, Minister of Megapolis and western Development, by virtue of thepowers vested in him under Section 8F of the said amended Law.\u201d\n\nDR. JAGATH MUNASINGHE,Chairman,Urban Development Authority.\n\n07th November, 2019,\n\nNotwithstanding the provisions contained in the antecedent Gazette Notification bearing No. 2129/95 dated 28th June,2019 (07-4554/10), the rectification herein before mentioned shall have retrospective effect and shall be deemed to havecome into operation on the 28th day of June, 2019.\n\nPATALI CHAMPIKA RANAWAKA,Minister of Megapolis and Western Development.\n\n07th November, 2019.\n\n11 - 1483\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
