    "chunk_text": "The content of the latter part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be rectified by establishing therelevance of the said Development Plan to, Anuradhapura Urban Development Area comprising of Anuradhapura MuncipalCouncil, Nuwaragam Palatha Central Pradehiya Sabha (Part) and Nuwaragama Palatha East Pradeshiya Sabha (Part) Areas.\n\nThe word \u201cAmendment Act\u201d given in the last line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substituted with\u201cAmended Law.\u201d\n\nThe rectifications introduced to the latter part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be read as follows:\n\n\u201cApproval of the Development Plan for the Anuradhapura Urban Development Area comprising of AnuradhapuraMunicipal Cooucil, Nuwaragam Palatha Central Pradeshiya Sabha (Part) and Nuwaragam Palatha East PradeshiyaSabha (Part) Areas.\u201d\n\nPublic are hereby informed that the Development Plan prepared under Section 8A of the Urban Development AuthorityLaw, No. 41 of 1978 as amended by the Act, No. 4 of 1982, for the Anuradhapura Urban Development Area comprising ofAnuradhapura Municipal Council, Nuwaragam Palatha Central Pradeshiya Shaba (Part) and Nuwaragam PalathaEast Pradeshiya Sabha (Part) areas has been approved on 28th June, 2019, by Hon. Patali Champika Ranawaka,Minister of Megapolis & Western Development, by virtue of the powers vested in him under Section 8F of the said amendedLaw.\u201d\n\nDR. JAGATH MUNASINGHE,Chairman,Urban Development Authority.\n\n07th November, 2019,\n\n3AI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'08PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 08.11.2019\n\nNotwithstanding the provisions contained in the antecedent Gazette Notification bearing No. 2129/95 dated 28th June,2019 (07-4554/9), the rectification hereinbefore mentioned shall have retrospective effect and shall be deemed to havecome into operation on the 28th day of June, 2019."
