    "md5": "f29cdda59c7a56f63a015058cc86dd05",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2018,
    "chunk_text": "The rectifications introduced to the upper part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be read as follows;\n\n\u201cNOTICE OF APPROVAL OF THE DEVELOPMENT PLAN FOR THE EMBILIPITIYA URBAN DEVELOPMENT AREACOMPRISING OF EMBILIPITIYA URBAN COUNCIL AND EMBILIPITIYA PRADESHIYA SABHA (PART) AREAS.\u201d\n\n\u201cNOTICE is hereby given to the General Public of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka under Section 8G of theUrban Development Authority Law, No. 41 of 1978 as amended from time to time that I, Patali Champika Ranawaka, theMinister in charge of the subject of Megapolis and Western Development, by virtue of the powers vested in me underSection 8F of the said Law, have approved the Development Plan on the 28th day of June, 2019 for the embilipitiyaUrban Development Area comprising of the Embilipitiya Urban Council an Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha (Part) areas,prepared under Section 8A of the said Law.\u201d\n\nPATALI CHAMPIKA RANAWAKA,Minister of Megapolis and Western Development.\n\n07th November, 2019.\n\nIn the caption of the latter part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification the word \u201c(Part)\u201d shall be included immediatelyafter \u201cEmbilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha\u201d and the word \u201cAuthority\u201d (given in the first line) shall be deleted.\n\nIn the content of the latter part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification the word \u201c(Amendment)\u201d in the second lineshall be substituted with \u201cLaw, No. 41 of 1978 as amended by the\u201d.\n\nThe word \u201c(Part)\u201d shall be inserted immediately after \u201cEmbilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha\u201d given in the third line in saidExtraordinary Gazette Notification.\n\nThe word \u201chave\u201d in the third line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be subsitituted with \u201chas\u201d.\n\nThe word \u201cAmendment Act\u201d given in the last line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substituted with\u201cAmended Law.\u201d\n\nThe rectification introduced to the latter part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be read as follows;"
  },
