    "chunk_text": "RAVINDRA SAMARAWEERA,Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations.\n\nColombo,04th November, 2019.\n\n11 - 1508/1\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nG31441 \u2013 26 (11/2019)\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/01/2018/221.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nOrder under Section 4 (1)\n\nWHEREAS AN industrial dispute in respect of the matter specified in the statement of the Commissioner of Labour which accompanies thisorder exists between,\n\nMr. E. Jeewagan, Malith Star House and Electrical, No. 61, Sevanagala Junction, Sevanagala.\n\nand\n\nLanka Sugar (Pvt) Ltd, Sevanagala.\n\nNOW THEREFORE I, Ravindra Samaraweera, Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations do by virtue of the powers vested in me bySection 4(1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (1956 Revised Edition), as amended byAct, Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial Disputes - Special Provisions) Act, No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint\n\nMr. K. A. Piyarathne, 224/14A, Malwatta Road, Kahantota, Malabe to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him forsettlement by arbitration.\n\nRAVINDRA SAMARAWEERA,Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations.\n\nColombo,04th November, 2019.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/01/2018/221.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nMr. E. Jeewagan, Malith Star House and Electrical, No. 61, Sevanagala Junction, Sevanagala.\n\nand\n\nLanka Sugar (Pvt) Ltd, Sevanagala.\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is .\u2013\n\n\u2018\u2018Whether Mr. E. Jeewagan who worked at Lanka Sugar (Pvt) Ltd Company has been caused injustice by not being given his promotion andpayment of the Grade S4 salary while stating the Grade S3 salary as his salary and if so, to what relief he is entitled.\u2019\u2019"
