    "chunk_text": "THE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE EN ACTMENTS OF CEYLON(1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nMr. A. W. K. Perera, No. 143/3, Horana Road, Mahawila, Panadura. of the one part\n\nand\n\nSri Lanka Transport Board, No. 200, Kirula Road, Colombo 05. of the other part\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is\n\nWhether Mr. A. W. K. Perera, who worked in the Sri Lanka Transport Board had beem caused injustice by not being paidcompensation and salaries from 13.12.2011 to 02.05.2012 in accordance with Staff Circular No. 04 of 1974 , at his retirement onmedical reasons and if so, to what reliefs he is entitled.\n\nA. WIMALAWEERA,Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the Office of the Commissioner General of Labour,Colombo, this 23rd day of October, 2019.\n\n11 \u2013 1512/2\n\nMy No.: IR/20/23/2013.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nRevocation of Order under Section 4(1)\n\nWHEREAS by Order made under Section 4(1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments ofCeylon (Revised Edition 1956), as amended by Acts, Nos. 14 and 62 of 1957, 14 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 read with IndustrialDisputes (Special Provisions) Act, No. 37 of 1968 dated 10.06.2014 and published in the Gazette of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka Extraordinary No. 1868/58 dated 25.06.2014 of the Industrial Dispute in respect of the matter specifiedin the statement of the Commissioner of Labour dated 12.05.2014.\n\nFree Trade Zones & General Services Employees Union, No. 141, Ananda Rajakaruna Mawatha, Colombo 10. of theone part\n\nand\n\nPalla & Company (Pvt.) Ltd, Super Road 04, Phase 1, Investment Promotion Zone, Katunayake. of the other part\n\nwas referred to Mr. P. Danansooriya for settlement by arbitration."
