    "chunk_size_bytes": 1891,
    "chunk_text": "THE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON(1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nOrder under Section 4(1)\n\nWHEREAS AN industrial dispute in respect of the matter specified in the statement of the Commissioner of Labour whichaccompanies this order exists between,\n\nand\n\nAirport and Aviation Services Sri Lanka Ltd, Bandaranaike International Airport, Katunayaka. of the other part\n\nNOW THEREFORE I, Ravindra Samaraweera, Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations do by virtue of the powersvested in me by Section 4(1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (1956 RevisedEdition), as amended by Act, Nos. 14 of 1957, 62 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial disputes-SpecialProvisions) Act, No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint Mrs. K. K. Kumari Dhanapala, 149/102, Madhra Uyana, Matthegoda to be thearbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to her for settlement by arbitration.\n\nRAVINDRA SAMARAWEERA,Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations.\n\nColombo,04th November, 2019.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/01/2018/241.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE EN ACTMENTS OF CEYLON(1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nMr. W. A. A. D. Pushpakumara, No. 80/7, Walaliyadda, Ellakkala. of the one part\n\nand\n\nAirport and Aviation Services Sri Lanka Ltd, Bandaranaike International Airport, Katunayaka. of the other part\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is\n\nWhether Mr. W. A. A. D. Pushpakumara, who worked as the Senior Accounts Assistant of Airport and Aviation Services SriLanka Ltd has been caused injustice by not being promoted to the post of Assistant Accountant and if so, to what relief he isentitled.\n\nA. WIMALAWEERA,Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the Office of the Commissioner General of Labour,Colombo, this 23rd day of October, 2019.\n\n11 - 1514"
