    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'11'13PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 13.11.20191A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2149$13 \u2013 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be 13 jeks nodod \u2013 2019'11'13No. 2149/13 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, NOVEMBER 13, 2019\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A \u2013 G 31451 \u2013 46 (11-/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nORDER UNDER SECTION 38(a)\n\nOrder No. 253 of 2019\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4-3/9/2015/IR/307.Divisional Sec. Ref No.: 4/3/2/3 j'm'we'jHd\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by order under Section 38 (a)of Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) I, Gayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands & Parliamentary Reforms do hereby direct theAcquiring Officer or any other officer authorized by him referred toin Columm 1 of the Schedule to take possession of the land specifiedin the corresponding entry in Columm II of that Schedule.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMinistry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla.04 November, 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Land Acquiring Officer.\u2013 Divisional Secretary, Galewela.\n\n2. Description of the land.\u2013 Allotments of land depicted inbelow names and extents in supplement No. 8 Extra No. 8 of theFinal Village Plan No. 337 dated 29.09.2017 prepared by theSurveyor-General, situated in the Village called Ranwediyawa in theGrama Niladhari Division of Kospotha Minor Division of KandaPalla Korale E 431 C in the Divisional Secretary' s Division ofGalewela in Mathale District in Central province and boundaries asfollows."
  },
