    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.10.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2149$32 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 15 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'11'15No. 2149/32 - FRIDAY NOVEMBER 15, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE COLOMBO MUNICIPALCOUNCIL UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of the return member of Colombo Municipal Council has fallen vacant by reason ofResignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the People\u2019s Liberation Front, the recognized political party to which BamunuAarachchige Ranil Chithrananda the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66A(1) of the aforesaidordinance, to decide upon returned member of People\u2019s Liberation Front who belongs to such party and is not disqualifiedunder section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within aperiod of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Hewapalatuwage Rohana Samantha Weerasinghe to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Pathiraja Arachchilage Sunil Senaratne, Returning Officer of the Colombo MunicipalCouncil, acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declarethat Hewapalatuwage Rohana Samantha Weerasinghe was selected as the member of the Colombo Municipal Council.\n\nP. A. S. SENARATNE,Returning Officer,Colombo Municipal Council.District Election Office,Colombo City,13th November, 2019.\n\n11 - 1680\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
