    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2150/25 - 2019 \u0dd9\u0db1\u02a3\u0dc0\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 20 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.11.20\n\nNo. 2150/25 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, NOVEMBER 20, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A PG 4761 \u2014 92 (2019/11)\n\nFOREST CONSERVATION ORDINANCE THE order under Section 3. that has to be read with Section 64. (1) of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451), as No 13 of 1966, as amended by Acts, No. 56 of 1979, No 13 of 1982, No 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009 that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.\n\nThe Order By virtue of powers vested in me by Section 3. of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451) as amended by Acts, No. 13 of 1966, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009, that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, Maithripala Sirisena, President do by this order declare the Kannankuda Mangrove Forest of 150.205 hectares bounded by the limit set forth in the schedule 01, Schedule 02 and Schedule 03 hereto as Kannankuda Mangrove Reserved Forest from 4th day of November, 2019. MAITHRIPALA SIRISENA, President. Colombo, 04th November, 2019.\n\n2 A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 : (1) \u0dd9\u014e\u0daf\u0dba - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0