    "chunk_text": "FOREST CONSERVATION ORDINANCE THE order under Section 3. that has to be read with Section 64. (1) of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451), as No. 13 of 1966, as amended by Acts, No. 56 of 1979, No 13 of 1982, No 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009 that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka. The Order By virtue of powers vested in me by section 3. of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451) as amended by Acts, No. 13 of 1966, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009, that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, Maithripala Sirisena, President do by this order declare the Vilava Forest of 66.63 hectares bounded by the limit set forth in the Schedule hereto asVilava Reserved Forest from 04th day of November, 2019. MAITHRIPALA SIRISENA President. Colombo, 04th day of November, 2019.\n\n2 A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 : (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba - 2019.11.20 PART I : Sec (1) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 20.11.2019\n\nFOREST CONSERVATION ORDINANCE THE order under Section 3. that has to be read with Section 64. (1) of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451), as No. 13 of 1966, as amended by Acts, No. 56 of 1979, No 13 of 1982, No 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009 that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka."
