    "chunk_text": "1A - PG 4767 - 120 (2019/11)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from w.w.w.documents.gov.lk.\n\nForest Conservation Ordinance\n\nThe order under section 3. that has to be read with Section 64. (1) of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451), as No. 13 of 1966, as amended by Acts, No. 56 of 1979, No 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009 that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka. The Order By virtue of powers vested in me by section 3. of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451) as amended by Acts, No. 13 of 1966, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009, that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I Maithripala Sirisena, President do by this order declare the Sinharaja Forest of 36474.93 hectares bounded by the limit set forth in the schedule 1 and 2 hereto as Sinharaja Reserved Forest from 11th day of November, 2019. Gazette Extra ordinary No.5118 of May 12, 1893 declaring Panila Forest Gazette Extra ordinary No.4988 of April 03, 1896 declaring Walankanda Forest Gazette Extra ordinary Notice No.5203 of February 10, 1893 declaring Madampe Forest Gazette Extra ordinary No.4569 of December 13, 1889 declaring Nahitiya Forest Gazette Extra ordinary No.4046 of May 08, 1875 declaring Sinharaja Forest Gazette Extra ordinary No.7526 of May 21, 1926 declaring Sinharaja Forest are hereby repealed. MAITHRIPALA SIRISENA, President. 11th day of November, 2019 Colombo\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority) PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0d