    "chunk_size_bytes": 2160,
    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2150/32 - 2019 \u0dd9\u0db1\u02a3\u0dc0\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 20 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.11.20\n\nNo. 2150/32 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, NOVEMBER 20, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A - PG4768 - 96 (2019/11)\n\nForest Conservation Ordinance\n\nTHE order under Section 3. that has to be read with Section 64.(1) of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451),\n\nas No. 13 of 1966, as amended by Acts, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of\n\n2009 that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic\n\nof Sri Lanka.\n\nThe Order\n\nBy virtue of powers vested in me by Section 3. of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451) as\n\namended by Acts, No. 13 of 1966, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009,\n\nthat have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri\n\nLanka,\n\nI, Maithripala Sirisena, President do by this order declare the Karathivu Mangrove Forest of 25.80 hectares bounded\n\nby the limit set forth in the schedule hereto as Karathivu Mangrove Reserved Forest from 04th day of November,\n\n2019. \u0dd9\u25cc\n\nMAITHRIPALA SIRISENA. President, 04th day of November of 2019, Colombo.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n2 A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 I : \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.11.20 PART I : Sec I : \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 20.11.2019\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nThe state land area of 25.80 ha. located within Karathivu Divisionals Secretary\u2019s Division of Ampara District, Eastern Province in Sri Lanka located Within the area depicted by the following geodesic coordinates (Survey method \u2013 Geodesic coordinates EPSG : 5234 method)."
  },
