    "chunk_text": "The state land area of 25.80 ha. located within Karathivu Divisionals Secretary\u2019s Division of Ampara District, Eastern Province in Sri Lanka located Within the area depicted by the following geodesic coordinates (Survey method \u2013 Geodesic coordinates EPSG : 5234 method).\n\nFOREST CONSERVATION ORDINANCE\n\nTHE order under Section 3. that has to be read with Section 64.(1) of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter\n\n451), as No. 13 of 1966, as amended by Acts, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No.\n\n65 of 2009 that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist\n\nRepublic of Sri Lanka.\n\nThe Order\n\nBy virtue of powers vested in me by Section 3. of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451) as amended by\n\nActs, No. 13 of 1966, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009, that have to\n\nbe read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I,\n\nMaithripala Sirisena, President do by this order declare the Dedduwa thalan kalapuwa Mangrove Forest of 64.7\n\nHectares bounded by the limit set forth in the Schedule hereto as Dedduwa thalan kalapuwa Mangrove Reserved\n\nForest from 04th day of November, 2019.\n\nMAITHRIPALA SIRISENA President, . 04th day of November of 2019, Colombo.\n\n3A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 I : \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.11.20 PART I : Sec I : \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 20..11.2019\n\nSCHEDULE"
